## The gatehouse

::bg{location="route-2-gatehouse" time="day"}
::actor{character="aide" anchor="center" action="enter"}
@aide{code="0010"}: You're the professor's new helper! Ten kinds caught already? He told me to give you this if you ever got that far.
::use{component="obtain" item="hmFlash" instance="use-001"}
